      {
        "id": 206876,
        "name": "Killswitch",
        "username": "Killswitch",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-06T15:57:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I suggested on the KS page, I'd really love to have a checklist of all the challenges in Challenge Mode I've successfully completed. I have a pencil and paper version of them when playing with my group (as well as the team we chose and date completed), and think this would be a really cool addition to the video game as an added incentive to tackle tougher matchups. Maybe one for Advanced mode as well.</p><p>Also, since we've been getting more and more variants it would be really nice to have a tab or button somewhere to select a variant, rather than cycling through them all with each click.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:36:26.507Z",
