      {
        "id": 206877,
        "name": "bobbertoriley",
        "username": "bobbertoriley",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/{size}/1910_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-06T16:39:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The big feature that I'd like to see is to be able to re-roll with randomize but lock in certain decks/numbers so that they stay the same.&nbsp;<span>For example, being able to say that (H)=4, or that I want to play against Citizen Dawn with The Naturalist as one of the heroes, but don't care what else comes up.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In multiplayer, I'd love to see players other than the host be able to select the villain/environment and to reorder heroes</p>",
