      {
        "id": 206879,
        "name": "bobbertoriley",
        "username": "bobbertoriley",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/{size}/1910_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-06T16:54:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The problem with that is that if you then want to re-roll, you have to basically remove everything. Or, as you mentioned, if you like 3 of the 4 heroes selected, you can't just randomize the fourth one.</p><p>It'd be more of a UI/UX convenience than anything else.</p>",
