      {
        "id": 206880,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-06T18:17:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"bobbertoriley\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/48/1910_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> bobbertoriley:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>In multiplayer, I'd love to see players other than the host be able to select the villain/environment and to reorder heroes</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Honestly, I prefer everyone coming to a verbal agreement of what they play. If everyone could just swap it out, you know we'd get those players that just things out or remove a deck before playing just to be a troll.</p>",
