        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-07T16:24:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you want improvements to the randomizer faster than we can prioritize &amp; implement them, now you can do it yourself (or find a programmer to help)!</p><p>We've published the specs for launching Sentinels from any app/website. Sentinels Sidekick can do it now, too.</p><p>http://sentinelsdigital.com/launch</p>",
