        "created_at": "2017-11-08T05:28:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you want improvements to the randomizer faster than we can prioritize &amp; implement them, now you can do it yourself (or find a programmer to help)!We've published the specs for launching Sentinels from any app/website. Sentinels Sidekick can do it now, too.<a href=\"http://sentinelsdigital.com/launch\">http://sentinelsdigital.com/launch</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>SO. COOL!</p>",
