      {
        "id": 206888,
        "name": "Dandolo",
        "username": "Dandolo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-08T14:02:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A feature I’d love to see added since my memory is terrible, would be a list of cards that have been revealed within a round/last few turns to be added to the dropdown list of active effects.</p>\n<p>I run into this issue with Parse’s cards and at MMFFCC all the time where I’ll really struggle to remember what cards I’ve revealed on what decks. With the addition of Freedom 5 Bunker I will probably need to rewind in many 4-5 hero games where I use his power because I’ll probably have forgotten at least 1 card I revealed by the time I finish revealing cards.</p>",
